meta {
  name: FCG APIs
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Correlation-ID: {{correlationId}}
}

vars:pre-request {
  usersUrl: http://localhost:5101
  catalogUrl: http://localhost:5102
  paymentsUrl: http://localhost:5103
  notificationsUrl: http://localhost:5104
  adminEmail: admin@fcg.com
  adminPassword: AdminSenha@123
  userName: Joao Silva
  userPassword: Senha@123
  correlationId: demo-video-001
}

docs {
  No Bruno, selecione o ambiente Docker na barra lateral.
  Tokens e IDs sao gravados em runtime apos Login/Create (vars:post-response).
  Nao declare userToken/adminToken/userId/gameId no ambiente — o valor vazio tapa o da resposta.
}
